{"name": "Alchi", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mix devious combos in your cauldron</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a unique, turn-based card mixing system. It\u2019s as simple as tossing four cards into your cauldron, but discovering the perfect order and placement to maximize your combos is a complex, addicting puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/4eeb1b59db07fa35485b585be0362e74.poster.avif?t=1786567320\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/4eeb1b59db07fa35485b585be0362e74.webm?t=1786567320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/4eeb1b59db07fa35485b585be0362e74.mp4?t=1786567320\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Curate your bag of ingredients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter 10+ unique helpers throughout your run who can radically alter your deck. Upgrade your ingredients, change their properties, or even cut cards in half to craft the ultimate bag of ingredients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/6f9486524925ced9dea96c34620ba949.poster.avif?t=1786567320\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/6f9486524925ced9dea96c34620ba949.webm?t=1786567320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/6f9486524925ced9dea96c34620ba949.mp4?t=1786567320\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless synergies to discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as 6 distinct characters, each with completely unique mechanics. Discover 100+ cards across five themed suits and use them to conquer 30+ dangerous enemies, each wielding their own deadly afflictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/d98b3418c10c16b1405c374d1c20fdca.poster.avif?t=1786567320\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/d98b3418c10c16b1405c374d1c20fdca.webm?t=1786567320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/extras/d98b3418c10c16b1405c374d1c20fdca.mp4?t=1786567320\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Alchi is the first game from HOMEK, with music by weirdcore (Dario). No generative AI was used in any form of asset creation.</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Alchi is a roguelike deckbuilder built around a unique card-mixing system. Slay monsters, unlock distinct characters, and craft outrageously powerful combos by manipulating and mutating your deck!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948610/64b4087f9630cf55e2b8feca0367c8d0c3ab1c23/header.jpg?t=1786567320", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Card Battler", "Roguelike", "Roguelite"], "developers": "HOMEK", "publishers": "HOMEK", "release_date": "Aug 12, 2026", "price": "$